quiet.md #6: grid_col_widths, explicit pixel widths for grid columns

`grid_col_widths(Vec<f32>)` sets `grid-template-columns: <w1>px <w2>px …` and
overrides `grid_cols`. Tables keep the column widths the user dragged.

